  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<h1>Prometheus</h1>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/I80VLV.svg\" width=\"155\" height=\"56\"> </a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/modrinth-734077874708938864\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/Bi4Cuo.svg\" width=\"162\" height=\"56\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/resourceful-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/jUWHY2.svg\" width=\"202\" height=\"56\"> </a><hr>\n<h2>📖 關於 📖</h2>\n<p>以從眾神那裡竊取火種並將其賦予人類，為他們帶來豐富資源的狡黠之神命名。Prometheus 是一款實用模組，讓用戶能夠使用有用的指令和快捷工具，並為伺服器管理員提供對玩家權限、傳送點甚至自訂指令腳本的強大控制力。</p>\n<img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1104954543797702747/1104965771672703067/java_4zLYpJSvG6.gif\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/881359242492252170/1110615032896700416/image.png\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/881359242492252170/1110615118175281212/image.png\"> <br><hr><br>\n<h2>探索奧德賽計劃的其他作品！</h2>\n<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/argonauts\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/05PfzF.svg\" alt=\"Argonauts\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/experience-obelisk\" rel=\"nofollow\"> </a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/heracles\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/RzlEoy.svg\" alt=\"Heracles\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/experience-obelisk\" rel=\"nofollow\"> </a><a href=\"https://github.com/terrarium-earth/Hermes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/gD9eSY.svg\" alt=\"Hermes\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/experience-obelisk\" rel=\"nofollow\"> </a><a href=\"https://www.c